{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33984","headline":"夏景冲澹偶然作二首 一 · 皮日休","name":"夏景冲澹偶然作二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秖隈蒲褥岸乌纱，味道澄怀景便斜。\n红印寄泉慙郡守，青筐与笋媿僧家。\n茗炉尽日烧松子，书案经时剥瓦花。\n园吏暂栖君莫笑，不妨犹更着南华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33984.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33984","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}